            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um ein Set-Element wie <code>\"Music\"</code> zu entfernen, schreiben wir den Set-Namen <code>classes</code> gefolgt von <code>.remove()</code> mit dem Element in Klammern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"classes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Geometry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;French&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"classes.remove(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(classes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Geometry', 'French'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>classes</code>, gefolgt von <code>.remove</code> und schließlich <code>(\"Music\")</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um ein Set-Element wie <code>\"Music\"</code> zu entfernen, schreiben wir den Set-Namen <code>classes</code> gefolgt von <code>.remove()</code> mit dem Element in Klammern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"classes\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;Geometry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;French&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"classes\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"remove\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"classes\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".add\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>classes</code>, gefolgt von <code>.remove</code> und schließlich <code>(\"Music\")</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
